  /// Pacific (Tokyo), Asia Pacific (Singapore), Asia Pacific (Sydney), South
  /// America (São Paulo), and Asia Pacific (Mumbai). The environment type
  /// LINUX_EC2 is available only in regions US East (N. Virginia), US East
