  /// (Tokyo), Asia Pacific (Singapore), Asia Pacific (Sydney), South America
  /// (São Paulo), and Asia Pacific (Mumbai). The environment type
  /// LINUX_GPU_CONTAINER is available only in regions US East (N. Virginia),
  /// US East (Ohio), US West (Oregon), EU (Ireland), EU (Frankfurt), Asia
  /// Pacific (Tokyo), and Asia Pacific (Sydney). The environment type MAC_ARM
  /// is available for Medium fleets only in regions US East (N. Virginia), US
  /// East (Ohio), US West (Oregon), Asia Pacific (Sydney), and EU (Frankfurt)
  /// The environment type MAC_ARM is available for Large fleets only in
  /// regions US East (N. Virginia), US East (Ohio), US West (Oregon), and
  /// Asia Pacific (Sydney). The environment type WINDOWS_EC2 is available
  /// only in regions US East (N. Virginia), US East (Ohio), US West (Oregon),
  /// EU (Ireland), EU (Frankfurt), Asia Pacific (Tokyo), Asia Pacific
  /// (Singapore), Asia Pacific (Sydney), South America (São Paulo), and Asia
  /// Pacific (Mumbai). The environment type WINDOWS_SERVER_2019_CONTAINER is
