  /// (Oregon), Asia Pacific (Sydney), Asia Pacific (Tokyo), Asia Pacific
  /// (Mumbai) and EU (Ireland). The environment type
  /// WINDOWS_SERVER_2022_CONTAINER is available only in regions US East (N.
  /// Virginia), US East (Ohio), US West (Oregon), EU (Ireland), EU
  /// (Frankfurt), Asia Pacific (Sydney), Asia Pacific (Singapore), Asia
  /// Pacific (Tokyo), South America (São Paulo) and Asia Pacific (Mumbai).
