  /// Pacific (Tokyo), Asia Pacific (Singapore), Asia Pacific (Sydney), South
  /// America (São Paulo), and Asia Pacific (Mumbai). The environment type
  /// LINUX_EC2 is available only in regions US East (N. Virginia), US East
  /// (Ohio), US West (Oregon), EU (Ireland), EU (Frankfurt), Asia Pacific
  /// (Tokyo), Asia Pacific (Singapore), Asia Pacific (Sydney), South America
  /// (São Paulo), and Asia Pacific (Mumbai). The environment type
  /// LINUX_GPU_CONTAINER is available only in regions US East (N. Virginia),
